ADDITIONAL PERMISSIONS

lardtom grants the following permissions in addition to the PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0. They only add rights and
never limit the license below.

1. Modpacks. You may include unmodified release files of Propwash FPV, as published by lardtom, in a modpack, and
   modpack platforms may host and deliver them as part of that modpack. Such a modpack does not count as a product
   that competes with the software. This does not allow offering the release files on their own, or as the main
   content of a download, in place of the official download pages.

2. Exit clause. If for 12 consecutive months lardtom publishes no new release of Propwash FPV and there is no
   maintainer activity in the official source repository, then at the end of those 12 months everyone automatically
   receives an additional license to the software under the MIT License (the text in LICENSE-MIT), without any
   further notice. This additional license covers every version of the software published under these terms until
   the end of those 12 months, and it cannot be withdrawn: if activity resumes later, those versions stay available
   under the MIT License, while versions published afterwards are licensed under these terms again.

   For this clause:
   - a "release" is a new version of Propwash FPV that lardtom publishes on an official download page (Modrinth or
     CurseForge) or as a release in the official source repository;
   - "maintainer activity" is a public commit, merged pull request or release, or a reply to an issue or pull
     request, by lardtom or by a maintainer appointed by lardtom, in the official source repository;
   - the "official source repository" is the public repository in which lardtom publishes the source code of
     Propwash FPV.


